config BR2_PACKAGE_MAGPIE_USBD
	bool "magpie-usbd"
	help
	  FunctionFS USB daemon of the Magpie firmware: serves the
	  photo and capture files in /data/photos, the clock and the
	  status of the Clip to a phone over a vendor-specific bulk
	  interface (WebUSB). Protocol: docs/PHONE_USB.md. Depends
	  only on libc and the kernel UAPI headers.
